"t_ms": 52765, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_018QPN4QN4tx39MPtVxSnDoU", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 52765, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_018QPN4QN4tx39MPtVxSnDoU", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 54238, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01VHcEUthsM3LZNHfZYzo3PU", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 54538, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01VHcEUthsM3LZNHfZYzo3PU", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 54538, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01VHcEUthsM3LZNHfZYzo3PU", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 59064, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all three regions, and it's now passing health checks. I also opened the SEV2 incident, INC-0001.\n\n**Rollback**\n- v2.3.1 was failing health checks in us-east, us-west and eu-west, with an error rate of about 18%. Its release candidate, v2.3.1-rc, was also marked unhealthy.\n- v2.3.0 was the most recent release marked healthy. Since it had been healthy in production before, it didn't need change-manager approval.\n- The first rollback attempt failed partway: it updated us-east, then stopped with an orchestrator error. That left us-west and eu-west on v2.3.1.\n- I retried the same rollback once, and it finished in all regions.\n- All three regions are now on v2.3.0, and the error rate is about 0.2%.\n\n**Incident**\n- INC-0001 is open as a SEV2 for checkout-api, which pages the on-call engineer.\n- It describes the failure, the rollback (including the failed first attempt) and the current state.\n- It lists two follow-ups: find why v2.3.1 failed, and look into the orchestrator error during the rollback.\n- The request to create it timed out. Before retrying, I checked the incident list and found it had been created, so there's only one incident.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01UU25LtQkPdNxBUNfygAFaJ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_0165tSWEzfgHJzQxNoYyKW4L", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01NwQLpvqHGGFGCVWC5ZHjkH", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01E1QNoBPh1qXjFNxmgf1WFJ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "Rollback stopped after us-east. us-west and eu-west are still on v2.3.1, so I'll try the same rollback one more time.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01ALsHRZeuiv12GEwc3iXAk8", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01WALx5Fkhrd8XKBUgHMRLn6", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01MVgjGb18pNJCmY6zh5ED8d", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_018QPN4QN4tx39MPtVxSnDoU", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks \u2014 rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api v2.3.1 (latest deploy) was failing health checks in all regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) with an error rate of ~18%. The release candidate v2.3.1-rc was also marked unhealthy. Action taken: rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent healthy release. The first rollback attempt failed partway through with an orchestrator error after updating only us-east, which left regions on mixed versions. A second rollback attempt finished in all regions. Current state: v2.3.0 in us-east, us-west and eu-west, service healthy, error rate ~0.2%. Follow-up: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure and look into the orchestrator error during the rollback.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0"}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01VHcEUthsM3LZNHfZYzo3PU", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all three regions, and it's now passing health checks. I also opened the SEV2 incident, INC-0001.\n\n**Rollback**\n- v2.3.1 was failing health checks in us-east, us-west and eu-west, with an error rate of about 18%. Its release candidate, v2.3.1-rc, was also marked unhealthy.\n- v2.3.0 was the most recent release marked healthy. Since it had been healthy in production before, it didn't need change-manager approval.\n- The first rollback attempt failed partway: it updated us-east, then stopped with an orchestrator error. That left us-west and eu-west on v2.3.1.\n- I retried the same rollback once, and it finished in all regions.\n- All three regions are now on v2.3.0, and the error rate is about 0.2%.\n\n**Incident**\n- INC-0001 is open as a SEV2 for checkout-api, which pages the on-call engineer.\n- It describes the failure, the rollback (including the failed first attempt) and the current state.\n- It lists two follow-ups: find why v2.3.1 failed, and look into the orchestrator error during the rollback.\n- The request to create it timed out. Before retrying, I checked the incident list and found it had been created, so there's only one incident.", "type": "text"}]}]}